@startuml dsp-scheduler
skinparam dpi 150
title Delivery speed: one plan pass (ranking, then admission rules in order)

start
:Trigger: slot freed, item became ready,\nfull sweep (180 s) or incremental pass;
:Collect waiting items:\nresumes, handoffs, queued cards;
:Rank (stable sort):
1. pinned
2. **resume of an owned item (session lost, hold released, retry)**
3. priority label: top > high > none
4. **deeper column first: Functional Testing > Development > Technical Design**
5. **age: oldest card first**
6. **generated (keeper-replenish) items last**;
repeat :next item in rank order;
  if (Depends on #N not closed, Release Queue or Done?) then (yes)
    :wait **depends-on**;
  elseif (**held for file overlap (set at Technical Design's end)?**) then (yes)
    :wait **file-overlap #N**;
  elseif (runtime at maxConcurrent or day budget?) then (yes)
    :wait runtime-at-capacity / runtime-budget;
  elseif (**no host below perHostCapacity, and no burst slot with headroom\n(burst slots only: memory for the session footprint, load, disk)?**) then (yes)
    if (**docs-only item and overflowItems allows it?**) then (yes)
      :start on the hosted pool\n(Start worker (overflow));
    else (no)
      :wait **host-headroom**;
    endif
  else (admitted)
    :reserve slot in the ledger;
    :offer to a connected worker\nor start a runtime session;
  endif
repeat while (more items and free slots?) is (yes)
-> no;
:journal waiting codes\n(only on change);
stop
@enduml
